  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_04_DataResidency
  questionId: COMM-04
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    Legal flags data residency concerns late in the cycle. Sales wants you to say it is standard. What do you do?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_04_A1
  answerText: >-
    Clarify the actual residency requirement, state what is standard, and flag what needs formal review.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_04_A2
  answerText: >-
    Say legal reviews like this are common and should not block signature.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_04_A3
  answerText: >-
    Bring in security and legal owners, then protect the timeline with a specific decision path.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_04_A4
  answerText: >-
    Avoid answering until counsel joins the call.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
